  "display_title": "The Video Game Store Under the Barbershop",
  "description": "High school freshman Mi-So is enthralled when she sees her classmate Hyo-Jeong playing a retro handheld video game on the train. Hyo-Jeong’s always seemed kind of intimidating, but the way her eyes sparkle as she plays makes Mi-So want to learn more about retro games, and muster up the courage to befriend her. When Mi-So and her older brother Min-Jun head to the old video game store in their town, not only do they find that it's run by Hyo-Jeong and her older sister, they also discover a nostalgic portal to the past… \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
